{
    "title": "Hunch - chat, vibe, date",
    "description": "1. Answer fun polls\r\n2. Get matched with like minded people\r\n3. Send a wave and start chatting!\r\n\r\nImagine a dating app that could help you chat with strangers to make friends who think like you? Hunch does exactly that!\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s a poll-based dating app designed to help you make friends who think like you. Answer a variety of polls on fun topics, show off your rizz and let the app's AI match you with your like-minded fam who shares the same thoughts and opinions as you. Hunch gives you a match score based on your answers to polls, helping you find people who really get you because you both think like each other. Be your authentic self, answer polls honestly, and chat with strangers. Hunch helps you easily talk to strangers and chat online with people who like the same things you do.\r\n\r\nThink of it as a dating app that allows you to be your real self, chat with strangers online over text, and connect with those who think like you and become bff. It's your gateway to anonymous chat with strangers and genuine connections. Discuss your thoughts through chat with strangers, ask relationship questions, or simply share what's on your mind. Join interesting questions and connect with someone and have fun while being yourself.\r\n\r\nIn a world where connecting & random chat with strangers requires effort, Hunch simplifies the process. Have fun answering quirky polls, show off your rizz and let the AI find no fizz matches for you automatically. From discussions on Hollywood, Bollywood, TV Shows, Relationship, Dating, Philosophy, Religion, to Fashion, and Makeup, Hunch helps you talk to strangers over diverse topics. No need to swipe endlessly or over analyze profiles for green flags!\r\n\r\nSo, why choose Hunch over other dating apps?\r\n\r\n<b>Interest-based Matching through AI:</b> Tired of swiping to meet new people? Hunch makes it fun by matching you based on your answers to quirky polls. Show off your rizz by answering questions, suggested by the app's AI. Follow your matches, connect, make friends online effortlessly!\r\n\r\n<b>Poll-Based Engagement:</b> Express your opinions on topics like Hollywood, dating, relationship, celebrities, gossip, memes, pop culture, college news, social issues, and football and other wizz. Join polls, share thoughts and find out what others think about things you care about, like relationships. Make friends online, addchat, have soda with fizz based on shared poll responses, mutual interests and rizz.\r\n\r\n<b>Verification:</b> Hunch ensures that when you make friends and talk online, you\u2019re talking to real people. Verification is mandatory and just requires you to upload one image. So when you\u2019re on Hunch you know there\u2019s no fizz only rizz.\r\n\r\n<b>Waves:</b> When you chat online, they become a part of your vibe tribe which is basically your fam on Hunch. The more you engage through polls, and comments - the more matches you get, the more you can chat with strangers and make connections. Send a wave to your suggested matches, addchat, have soda with fizz so we know who you like to chat online with.\r\n\r\n<b>Hunch+ Premium:</b> It's the premium tier of your favourite dating app to chat with strangers Hunch+ is designed for users who crave a smoother, ad-free experience with special features that enable people to find more new matches, and chat online. Hunch+ comes with weekly & monthly subscription plans which automatically renew unless canceled at least 24-hours before the end of the subscription period. Hunch+ has a weekly subscription fee of $9.99 and a monthly subscription fee of $29.99.\r\n\r\nExplore the world of dating apps, meet new people, start random conversations, become bff, addchat, have soda with fizz and ask questions anonymously on any topic like relationships, share random thoughts, and connect authentically on Hunch. Be yourself without hesitation, thanks to this unique social dating app!\r\n\r\nReady to dive in? Download Hunch now, show off your rizz, talk to strangers and find your perfect match.",
